  "id": "BIT-redmine-2026-133115",
  "summary": "Redmine 6.1.0 before 6.1.6 and 7.0.0 before 7.0.3 OAuth Scope Bypass in Project Creation",
  "details": "Redmine 6.1.0 before 6.1.6 and 7.0.0 before 7.0.3 contains an incorrect authorization vulnerability that lets OAuth clients exceed token scope during project creation. A client with only project-creation scope can set is_public, enabled_module_names and inherit_members, making projects public and granting parent-project members subproject access.",
